1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,508
Writing, task two. E-mail number 20: The exam.

2
00:00:05,367 --> 00:00:16,519
You passed your Czech exam. Write an e-mail to your course teacher. Write an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:27,167
Dear Teacher,

4
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:30,409
I want to tell you that I passed my Czech exam!

5
00:00:30,667 --> 00:00:33,956
The listening was the hardest — people spoke very fast.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,123
Thank you very much for your lessons and your patience.

7
00:00:37,367 --> 00:00:40,891
Now I'll apply for permanent residence and keep learning Czech.

8
00:00:41,133 --> 00:00:44,710
I'd like to invite you for coffee and cake — are you free next week?

9
00:00:44,967 --> 00:00:52,253
This e-mail has 57 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

10
00:00:53,300 --> 00:01:01,657
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
